<title>JAPAN: Sawafuji Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sawafuji Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.69		vs	   10.95</p>
<p> Operating	   86    mln	  vs	  315    mln</p>
<p> Current	     86    mln	  vs	  276    mln</p>
<p> Net	    loss 47    mln	  vs	prft 211 mln</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 2.19 yen	  vs     prft 9.80 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sawafuji Electric Co Ltd is an electrical equipment maker affiliated with Hino Motors Ltd.</p>
